# The PostgreSQL variation point attaches to the proto example of the HTTP
# variation point, the one that keeps its lists in memory: it deletes that
# store and adds internal/infrastructure/postgres (the fixed code, the
# application's tables and migrations) and the migration job cmd/migrate. The
# base files it changes are the composition root, the service over the store
# with its scenarios (the repository, and the unavailable answer), and the
# module's build files.
base library/architecture/go/vp-http-api-in-go.skill/examples-proto
change cmd/todo/main.go
change internal/service/item_lists.go
change internal/service/features/item_lists.feature
change internal/service/test/steps_test.go
change go.mod
change go.sum
change Makefile
change README.md
delete internal/infrastructure/memory/*
